{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","卡卡"],["/names/en","Koko"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名可爱善良的辅助，能够为友军提供临时的伤害减免。"],["/description_i18n/en","A cute and kind Support to provide allies with a temporary DMG Reduction."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","走，去打架喽！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Let's go take it to 'em!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","啊呜啊呜，好吃，还要吃！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Mm! Mmm! Delicious! I want more!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","帕托，一起上！冲呀！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Patto! Let's go! Charge!!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","肚子好饿……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/en","My belly's empty..."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","可可！帕托！都厉害！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Koko! Patto! Both awesome!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","开饭了！冲呀！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Dinner time! Go go go!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","最喜欢帕托，嘿嘿！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Wow! My favourite! Patto!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","没有危险，该吃饭啦，嗯，好吃，帕托一起吃！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","All clear. Time to eat! Mm... Mmm... Delicious! Come and eat, Patto!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","怎么突然地震了？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Huh!? Er... What's with the sudden earthquake!?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇！连帕托也会喜欢的，好东西！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Wow! Something even Patto would like. It's great!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这是什么？可以吃吗？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","What is this? Can you eat it?"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","荒野蛮童"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Wild Child"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","大口吃肉，痛快玩耍，这就是横行荒野的秘诀！"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Eat heartily and play freely. That's the creed of the wild!"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","蜜糖攻势"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Sugar-Coated Menace"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","用可爱俘获每寸心田，把糖果装满每个口袋。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Armed with charm and cuteness, they steal hearts and stuff pockets with candy."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Limited Bundle"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","帕托也能坐下吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Can Patto sit here?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","晚饭吃什么呀！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","What are we having for dinner?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","超大份肉排！三份！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Three extra large steak sets!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","帕托的毛沾到雪啦！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Patto's fur is covered in snow!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","过节就要吃大肉排！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","A banquet means big, juicy steaks!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哈哈，有怪兽！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Haha, there's a monster lurking!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","今天要吃大餐！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's have a feast today!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","卡卡不认识字，任何一种都不认识。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Koko is unfamiliar with letters, not recognizing a single one."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","安丹德拉发现，卡卡在感知上有很强的天赋，可以和一些野兽心灵相通。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Antandra discovered that Koko possesses strong innate perception and can communicate with the minds of certain wild creatures."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","卡卡看到食物就会不顾周围状况，原地开吃，通常是帕托察觉到危险将她驮起来逃命。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Koko ignores her surroundings when she sees food, eating on the spot. If Patto senses any danger, he carries her away to safety."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","卡卡不记得父母的名字，说起妈妈，她会第一个想到安丹德拉。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Koko can't recall her parents' names; when mentioning her mother, Antandra is the first person she thinks of."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","卡卡十分宝贝自己的骨笛，轻易不让人碰，自己也没有成功吹响过。直到吹响的那天，噩梦降临了。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Koko values her bone flute dearly, rarely allowing others to touch it, but she has never successfully played it. The day she blew into it, a nightmare descended."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","卡卡精于识路，可以独自穿越高原与沙漠，但唯独到了城镇里，她会迷失方向：“那些大石头看起来都一个样！”"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Koko is skilled at navigating and can traverse rugged terrain on her own, but tends to lose her way in towns: \"All those big rocks look the same!\""],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","卡卡有时会呲着牙护食。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Occasionally, Koko bares her teeth to safeguard her food."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","卡卡不善识数，有时会听错别人提到的数字，比如把1听成2，结果执行完全不对的指令。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Numbers elude Koko's understanding; she sometimes confuses them, leading to instructions gone awry."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","卡卡和陆行鸟的相处不如叶角熊好，她觉得陆行鸟是一种桀骜——用卡卡的话说，尖锐的生物。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Koko's interactions with terrabirds aren't as smooth as with hornleaf bears; she perceives terrabirds as unruly or, in her words, \"sharp\" creatures."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","帕托是一只温驯的叶角熊，能够容忍第一次见面的小孩骑到它背上。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Patto is a gentle hornleaf bear. Upon their first meeting, Koko was already jumping on his back and riding him around. He'll give an occasional growl if she pulls too hard on his ears."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","卡卡，看起来帕托和你相处很好呢，它凶不凶？"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Koko, you seem to get along with Patto. Is he aggressive?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412070.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 卡卡 & 安丹德拉"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Koko & Antandra"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","卡卡喜欢安丹姐姐和帕托！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Koko loves Antandra and Patto!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412170.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412170.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Koko"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","帕托也能坐下吗？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Can Patto sit here?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415078.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415078.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Koko"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","超大份肉排！三份！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Three extra large steak sets!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415079.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415079.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Koko"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","帕托的毛沾到雪啦！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Patto's fur is covered in snow!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415387.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415387.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Koko"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","过节就要吃大肉排！"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","A banquet means big, juicy steaks!"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415388.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415388.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Koko"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","哇哈哈，有怪兽！"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Haha, there's a monster lurking!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415559.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415559.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Koko"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","今天要吃大餐！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Let's have a feast today!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415560.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415560.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","卡卡"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Koko"]]}